  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Toss the mixed roasted vegetables with olive oil, salt-free seasoning, and dried oregano on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 20 minutes or until tender.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the roasted vegetables, baby lettuce leaves, and chopped parsley.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice and tempering chocolate until smooth.",
    "Pour the lemon-chocolate dressing over the salad and toss to combine.",
    "Mince the garlic and sprinkle over the salad.",
    "Season with salt-free seasoning to taste.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
